  <front>
    <title>Diameter ITU-T Rw Policy Enforcement Interface Application</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="5431" stream="IETF"/>
    <author fullname="D. Sun" initials="D." surname="Sun">
      <organization showOnFrontPage="true">Alcatel-Lucent</organization>
      <address/>
    </author>
    <date year="2009" month="March"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document describes the need for a new pair of IANA Diameter
Command Codes to be used in a vendor-specific new application, namely
for the ITU-T Rec. Q.3303.3 - Rw interface used to send a request/response for authorizing network Quality of Service (QoS) resources
and policy enforcement in a network element, as one of the
recommendations of the International Telecommunication Union -
Telecommunication Standardization Sector (ITU-T).</t>
    </abstract>
